<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室内形成了一个社会群体，并且群体规模还在增大</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>经过观察，发现项目个体在超过200个时，每三天会有一名个体“死亡”，其余的个体会将同伴的“尸体”放入房屋中，30分钟后，房屋中的“尸体”会以未知方式随机转化为3个积木块。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-关闭记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室中建造了一座城市，其外观与██市完全一致</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00126" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00126-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790251" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588077877 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 12:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00514/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一<strong>只</strong>会让文字变得<strong>可爱</strong>的<strong>超赞</strong>的<strong>小精灵❤</strong>！简直<strong>绝赞❤❤❤</strong>！！！<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██<strong>年的美妙的一天</strong><br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong><strong>魅力十足</strong>的<strong>可爱的</strong>Dr.<strong>卡丽尔</strong>的<strong>敲可爱笔记本</strong>里！<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被Dr.<strong>卡丽尔爱着</strong>欧！！！<strong>赞赞赞！</strong><br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Dr.<strong>卡丽尔</strong>忽然发现，<strong>可爱笔记本</strong>里的文字<strong>爬满了办公室的文章呢！！！真是太赞了！</strong><br />
<strong>另加补充说明：</strong>被<strong>可爱</strong>的字都加粗了呢，看起来<strong>好可爱</strong>！！！</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">点这里的话可以看到没有可爱过的Dr.卡丽尔的话呢！</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>啊啊啊啊我是男的啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！为什么这东西[脏话删除]会出现在我的研究记录上！——Carriere博士</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00514" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00514" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00514-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-da" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6069540); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6069540&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790251" alt="Mr_DA" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6069540)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-da" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6069540); return false;">Mr_DA</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609596968 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Jan 2021 14:16</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个马克杯，当其内部装有任何液体时，将无法采用除饮用外的其他任何手段使其内部的液体与该项目分离。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-03无价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不要往这里面装一些奇奇怪怪的东西，否则谁装的就由谁来负责喝掉。</em>——站点主管██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00014" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00014-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790251" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806218 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:43</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00002/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个指甲剪，在其底部刻有“一劳永逸”字样。当按照常规指甲剪的用法来使用该项目时，被其剪除的指甲将在此后永远停止生长。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████市场<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-75<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>人总是在失去的时候才会追悔莫及。啊淦，我开始想念我那永远回不来的完美长指甲了，主要是短指甲挠痒痒真尼玛难受。我特么当初为什么要用这玩意剪得这么短啊啊啊！——特工Astra</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00002" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00002" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00002-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4376536&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790251" alt=" Universe647" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4376536)" /></a> <a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;">Universe647</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585674899 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 Mar 2020 17:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
